  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa-Europe Alliance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Providing a framework for a structured, continuous and strategic dialogue between African and European stakeholders from business, politics and civil society on investment climate and the priorities for reforms by setting up four Task Forces in the following key sectors: digital economy; transport and connectivity; sustainable energy and sustainable agriculture. It represents a direct continuation of the Sectoral Task Forces, established in the framework of the Africa-Europe Alliance.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
